### Unified Service Scheduler: example requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Seed ids are fixed (src/infrastructure/persistence/seed/fixtures.ts). Change @day to a future weekday.

@api = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@acme = 11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@beta = 11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@leeds = 22222222-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@race = 22222222-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@oil = 33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@alignment = 33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@customer = 44444444-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@vehicle = 55555555-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@alexTech = 66666666-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@alignBay = 77777777-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@day = 2026-11-10
@appointmentId = REPLACE_WITH_ID_FROM_BOOKING

### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health/ready

### Reference data: dealerships of my tenant
GET {{api}}/dealerships
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1

### Reference data: service catalogue
GET {{api}}/service-types
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1

### Technicians (with skills) at Acme Leeds
GET {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/technicians
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1

### Service bays (with capabilities) at Acme Leeds
GET {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/service-bays
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1

### US2: availability for an oil change
GET {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/availability?serviceTypeId={{oil}}&date={{day}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1

### US1: book (auto-assign). Re-send unchanged → 200 replay; change the body → 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/appointments
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1
Idempotency-Key: demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customer}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicle}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oil}}",
  "startAt": "{{day}}T10:00:00Z",
  "channel": "PHONE"
}

### US1: same vehicle, overlapping time → 409 VEHICLE_ALREADY_BOOKED
POST {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/appointments
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1
Idempotency-Key: demo-2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customer}}", "vehicleId": "{{vehicle}}", "serviceTypeId": "{{oil}}", "startAt": "{{day}}T10:15:00Z" }

### US4: book with a pinned technician (mode MANUAL)
POST {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/appointments
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1
Idempotency-Key: demo-3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customer}}", "vehicleId": "{{vehicle}}", "serviceTypeId": "{{oil}}", "startAt": "{{day}}T14:00:00Z", "technicianId": "{{alexTech}}" }

### Fetch one appointment
GET {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1

### US4: reassign the bay (send the version you last read; repeat → 409 STALE_VERSION)
PATCH {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/assignment
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serviceBayId": "{{alignBay}}", "version": 1 }

### US3: cancel (frees the slot immediately)
POST {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 2 }

### US5: day view
GET {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/appointments?date={{day}}&limit=20
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1

### US5: history (CREATED → REASSIGNED → CANCELLED)
GET {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/events
X-Tenant-ID: {{acme}}
X-User-ID: advisor-1

### Isolation: Beta Autos asking for Acme Leeds → 404
GET {{api}}/dealerships/{{leeds}}/technicians
X-Tenant-ID: {{beta}}
X-User-ID: beta-advisor
